   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dyslexia: Dictionary Close-up. Dyslexia, also known as reading disorder or alexia, is a learning disability characterized by trouble reading despite a normal intelligence. Selective focus and Canon EOS 5D Mark II with MP-E 65mm macro lens.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
